<p>A single pair is <strong>$69.99, down from $139.98</strong>, and the maker's site discounts further on two and three pairs — “up to 60% off.” Orders ship by <strong>USPS within 48 hours</strong> and arrive in <strong>2 to 5 business days</strong>, with a tracking number by email. Every order carries the <strong>90-day money-back guarantee</strong> and <strong>free size exchanges</strong>. Compared with the $150–$180 many owners describe having spent on “conventional” sneakers that still hurt, the risk here is postage.</p>

