<blockquote>“I am a woman in my 70's who has misaligned toes due to wearing high heels in my younger days. These shoes have made a huge difference in my ability to walk safely in my home… I like them so much, I purchased a second pair.”<cite>— Beverly A., verified purchaser</cite></blockquote>
<p><strong>If you have tried everything else</strong> — orthotics at $300 to $600 that only work in one pair of shoes, cushioned trainers that feel great in the shop, insoles, cortisone — you have been managing the symptom. Not one of those changes the shape your foot spends the day inside. This does.</p>

<figure class="narrow">
  <img src="/images/gf2-colours.webp" alt="Grounded Footwear Freedom in Pink Magnolia and Navy Tide" width="800" height="893" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  <figcaption>Two of the nine colourways. Maker's image.</figcaption>
</figure>

<h3>Is the Grounded Footwear Freedom right for you?</h3>
<p>If you:</p>
<ul class="check">
