  <li>Want the size risk taken off you — free exchanges, 90-day money back</li>
</ul>
<p>then this is the pair to start with.</p>

<h3>The clear winner</h3>
<p>The <a href="${GF_LINK}" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Grounded Footwear Freedom</strong></a> is widest where feet are actually widest. Flat underfoot. 70% lighter than a conventional shoe by the maker's figure. Machine washable. Rated 4.8 out of 5 by more than 13,000 customers. And the only pick here where getting the size wrong costs you nothing — <strong>free size exchanges</strong> on top of a <strong>90-day money-back guarantee</strong>.</p>
